  "MK-XS-F-159": "issued 2026-08-27 to a MoneyKeel/functions/cashflow function in family XS by mistake \u2014 that folder was not in the family map, so it fell to the default. Re-issued in CF as MK-CF-F-149. This number is retired and is never handed to anything else.",
